  "_source_note": "Source: 燃えよ剣（新装版）, Shiba Ryōtarō, Bungeishunjū e-book, 2020-04-20 (ASIN B086P34MVL;底本 the 2020-04-05 単行本; itself the new-edition of the 1998-09 ノベルス判). Vertical-rl. First published 1964. Spine has 78 documents; modeled as 68 titled novel chapters + 3 back-matter units. Documents NOT modeled as chapters: cover.xhtml (art reused byte-identical as the cover, 装画 アオジマイコ / 装丁 野中深雪); part0000 (title page, regenerated from metadata); part0001 (a device 縦書き layout notice, dropped); part0002 (the source 目次, regenerated as the TOC); part0074 (a provenance/底本 note, folded into this note and the translator's note); part0075 (奥付 colophon, folded into metadata: publisher 文藝春秋, 発行人 吉永龍太, 東京都千代田区紀尾井町3-23); part0076 (copyright + お断り boilerplate, dropped — its お断り explains that some kanji were simplified/shown as images, which is why the source shipped 8 gaiji glyphs).",
  "_gaiji_note": "The source encoded 8 characters as <img class='gaiji'> images (font could not carry them); ingest_epub.py substitutes them via data/gaiji_map.json so none is dropped: 遼 (in 司馬遼太郎), 茨 (茨木司), 頤, 葛 (葛山武八郎), 芦 (芦谷), and two reading marks — レ (kanbun kaeriten) and 㝎 (the 之定/Nosada variant of 定, discussed in ch16 as the smith Kanesada's signature glyph).",
  "subjects": [
